Package: fastmean
Title: Calculate Numeric Mean of Categorical Levels
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joshua", "Hellmann", , "johellm@student.ubc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This is an R package that includes a function called `num_mean_categorical`.
  The goal of fastmean is to allow a fast way to calculate the mean of one or more numeric variables for each level of a categorical variable using `num_mean_categorical`.
